    "label": "The Major",
    "notes": "To gain a comprehensive understanding of the discipline as a whole, students must take two courses in the sociocultural anthropology field and one course in each of the other three fields (see Overview). Students may take any upper-division course in the given area to fulfill this requirement. Students must complete 11 courses (44 to 52 units) as follows:"
